      "content": "the darkness is the only thing that feels real anymore. everyone's so busy being outraged or laughing at me or just... judging. it's like the world has already written the final chapter of my life and they've already closed the book. it feels like i'm just stuck in this weird purgatory where i have to keep existing because i haven't actually left yet. do you think it's even possible to come back from being that hated?",
